#: ../../source/users/interface/customize/organize_toolbars.rst:7
msgid "Organize toolbars"
msgstr "组织工具栏"

#: ../../source/users/interface/customize/organize_toolbars.rst:9
msgid ""
"The QElectroTech GUI allows having many different `toolbars`_ switched on to"
" make more friendly the application."
msgstr "QElectroTech GUI允许拥有许多不同的 `toolbars <toolbars_>`_ 开关，使应用程序更加友好。"

#: ../../source/users/interface/customize/organize_toolbars.rst:11
msgid "To display or hide `toolbars`_:"
msgstr "显示或隐藏 `工具栏 <toolbars_>`_ :"

#: ../../source/users/interface/customize/organize_toolbars.rst:13
msgid ""
"Select **Settings > Display** menu item to display the `panels`_ and "
"`toolbars`_ list."
msgstr "选择 **设置 > 显示** 菜单项以显示 `panels <panels_>`_ 和 `工具栏 <toolbars_>`_ 列表 。"

#: ../../source/users/interface/customize/organize_toolbars.rst:14
msgid ""
"Click on the different `toolbars`_ (Tools, Display, Diagram, Add and Depth) "
"which should be displayed or hidden."
msgstr "单击应当显示或隐藏的不同 `工具栏 <toolbars_>`_ (工具、显示、图表、添加和深度)。"

#: ../../source/users/interface/customize/organize_toolbars.rst:19
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech Settings > Display menu"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 设置 > 显示菜单"

#: ../../source/users/interface/customize/organize_toolbars.rst:21
msgid ""
"All `toolbars`_ are placed by default under `menu bar`_, in one row. The "
"user is free reorganizing the `toolbars`_. The `toolbars`_ can be organiced "
"in rows, columns at the left or right side from the `workspace`_ or as "
"floating toolbar."
msgstr ""
"所有 `工具栏 <toolbars_>`_ 默认都放在 `菜单栏 <menu bar_>`_ 下，排成一行。 用户可以自由重组 `工具栏 "
"<toolbars_>`_ 。 `工具栏 <toolbars_>`_ 可以从 `工作区 <workspace_>`_ 或作为浮动工具栏 。"

#: ../../source/users/interface/customize/organize_toolbars.rst:28
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech user interface"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech用户界面"

#: ../../source/users/interface/customize/organize_toolbars.rst:30
msgid "To change the organization of `toolbars`_:"
msgstr "更改 `工具栏 <toolbars_>`_ 的组织："

#: ../../source/users/interface/customize/organize_toolbars.rst:32
msgid "Left click at the left side from the `toolbar`_."
msgstr "从 `工具栏 <toolbar_>`_。"

#: ../../source/users/interface/customize/organize_toolbars.rst:33
msgid ""
"Without releasing the `toolbar`_, move the mouse to the final position."
msgstr "在不释放 `工具栏 <toolbar_>`_ 的情况下，将鼠标移动到最后位置。"

#: ../../source/users/interface/customize/organize_toolbars.rst:34
msgid "Release the `toolbar`_."
msgstr "释放 `工具栏 <toolbar_>`_。"

#: ../../source/users/interface/customize/organize_toolbars.rst:39
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech toolbars placement"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 工具栏设置"
